#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:65
#: e5a309eb78ba4d1798bcfb14c2ac4af8
msgid "Make sure Rally Point altitudes are high enough to clear terrain and buildings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:67
#: 04a251003cdc40ab8272bda14ca3b085
msgid "Because of the limited flash memory size on the APM2.x hardware the number of Rally Points is restricted to 10 on Plane and 6 on Copter -- this limit may be expanded on other platforms such as Pixhawk in the future."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:70
#: 3f64ff08418b4a4c8021813716236b19
msgid "On Plane, loiter radius for a Rally Point is the same as all other loiter points; determined by the :ref:`WP_LOITER_RAD <WP_LOITER_RAD>` parameter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:73
#: 4524dffeceb64849861f2010c23282fe
msgid "The :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>` or :ref:`RTL_ALT_M<RTL_ALT_M>` parameters are NOT used with Rally Points! The aircraft will transit to the Rally Point at the altitude specified when adding that point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:78
#: 43a69b34ca144d68ac01413de3a8a462
msgid "The following MAVLink parameters control Rally Point behavior:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:80
#: dd9d45a6ab06432d9f3eafd94eab9073
msgid ":ref:`RALLY_LIMIT_KM <RALLY_LIMIT_KM>` is the maximum distance a Rally Point may be from the aircraft to be considered for an RTL event.  If all Rally Points are greater than this distance from the aircraft, then the Home location is used for RTL events (at altitude :ref:`RTL_ALTITUDE <RTL_ALTITUDE>`) This parameter is to prevent fly offs if Rally Points have been specified for multiple flying fields. This parameter can be disabled if set to 0."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:87
#: 0c93876e078d4d9183a80a90141bf840
msgid ":ref:`RALLY_INCL_HOME<RALLY_INCL_HOME>` allows Home to be included in the RALLY points, allowing it to return to home if closer than any RALLY point."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-rally-points.rst:88
#: cfa7050dfe6042b28aa12c1409821b0f
msgid ":ref:`RALLY_TOTAL <RALLY_TOTAL>` is the number of Rally Points currently specified. This parameter will be set for you by your ground control station (e.g., Mission Planner) when you add and remove Rally Points.  **IT IS HIGHLY UNLIKELY YOU WANT TO SET THIS PARAMETER MANUALLY AND IT IS PROBABLY UNSAFE TO DO SO**.  RALLY_TOTAL should be 0 if you have specified no Rally Points and in this case the Home location will be used for RTL events."
msgstr ""

